# Local settings for Product Owner: the Code Mode credentials.
# ClickUp push targets live in claude project/local/, filled from claude project/templates/.
# Copy this file to .env and fill in what you use. .env is gitignored, so tokens
# stay on this machine and the public repository never carries them.
# A shell variable of the same name wins over the file.

# ── Code Mode credentials ────────────────────────────────────────
# .utcp_config.json loads this file. Code Mode prefixes each variable with its manual
# name, so the figma manual reads figma_FIGMA_API_KEY, never a bare FIGMA_API_KEY.
# The clickup_official manual needs no key: mcp-remote opens a ClickUp OAuth sign-in
# in the browser on first use. The cupt CLI keeps its own token through cupt auth.

# Optional. A Figma personal access token for the Framelink figma manual, from
# Figma, Settings, Account, Personal access tokens. figma-ds-cli needs none.
figma_FIGMA_API_KEY=


